        <div class="info-header">

            <span class="info-label">TERMS</span>

            <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>

            <p>
                Please read these terms before using CivicTrack.
            </p>

        </div>


        <section class="info-card">

            <h2>1. Use of CivicTrack</h2>

            <p>
                CivicTrack is intended to help users report and
                track genuine civic issues in their communities.
            </p>


            <h2>2. Accurate Information</h2>

            <p>
                Users should provide accurate and meaningful
                information when submitting an issue.
            </p>


            <h2>3. Prohibited Content</h2>

            <p>
                Users must not submit false reports, abusive
