            </p>


            <h2>4. Issue Resolution</h2>

            <p>
                CivicTrack provides a platform for reporting and
                tracking issues. Actual resolution depends on the
                responsible department or authority.
            </p>


            <h2>5. User Accounts</h2>

            <p>
                Users are responsible for maintaining the security
                of their accounts and for activities performed
                through their accounts.
            </p>


            <h2>6. Platform Changes</h2>

            <p>
                CivicTrack may modify, improve or update platform
                features when required.
            </p>


            <h2>7. Acceptance</h2>

            <p>
                By using CivicTrack, you agree to follow these
                terms and use the platform responsibly.
            </p>

        </section>

    </div>

</main>
